      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can probably fix your missing variant problems without having to add your own mutator by making this `android.InitAndroidArchModule(android.HostSupported, android.MultilibFirst)`.  That will make this a `linux-glibc_x86_64` variant, which will match up better with the libraries you\u0027re depending on.  You may also have to add the \"static\" or \"shared\" variant when depending on libraries.",
